# --- Walkthrough video masters ---
# Raw screen recordings, kept out of the repo: what ships is the encoded set in
# frontend/public/videos/, produced from here by frontend/scripts/encode-videos.sh.
# Committing both would carry the same footage twice, the masters being the
# larger copy. Keep these in cloud storage so a walkthrough can be re-encoded.
/videos/
